flowchart TB
  Source[Primary tagged song and SHA-256] --> Root{Extra root available?}
  Root -->|no| Fail[Report error; retain source]
  Root -->|yes| Existing{Target already exists?}
  Existing -->|yes| Match{Digest matches?}
  Match -->|yes| Reuse[Reuse verified target]
  Match -->|no| Conflict[Preserve both; report conflict]
  Existing -->|no| Temp[Write owned partial file / flush / fsync]
  Temp --> Verify{Partial digest matches?}
  Verify -->|no| Cleanup[Remove owned partial; report error]
  Verify -->|yes| Atomic[Publish final name without replacing]
  Atomic --> Next[Proceed to next root]
  Reuse --> Next
